{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last caretaker; a reawakened machine tasked with saving the future of the human race. You will explore a vast ocean world featuring a deep crafting system with limited resources, allowing you to forge your path and build the tools to save humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Earth has been swallowed by the ocean as towering megastructures rust under a yawning sky. The Last Caretaker isn't just about survival, it's about discovery. Your choices shape the narrative, offering a personal and thought-provoking adventure that reaches from the sea to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Caretaker is a thoughtful take on the survival-crafting genre, where every decision you make and every action has a consequence. Immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted world where the fate of humanity rests in your hands. Your mission is clear: recover human seeds, reactivate the Lazarus Complex, and launch the last of humanity to the stars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/4800278216694b11d5c98912744370b9.avif?t=1770805760\" width=1024 height=1288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NURTURE HUMANS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/3ce33ea5a0a5d3e77dd474daa9801c6b.poster.avif?t=1770805760\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/3ce33ea5a0a5d3e77dd474daa9801c6b.webm?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/3ce33ea5a0a5d3e77dd474daa9801c6b.mp4?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for and grow human seeds within the Lazarus Complex, managing crucial systems like incubation temperature, nutrient flow, and memory data integration. Unlock advanced biopods and synthetic caretakers to accelerate development and ensure successful revival. Discover emotional imprints and past memories encoded in each seed, piecing together lost human stories as you bring life back into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROTECT HUMANS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/0c61710ca690e57114dffd4779e9b87a.poster.avif?t=1770805760\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/0c61710ca690e57114dffd4779e9b87a.webm?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/0c61710ca690e57114dffd4779e9b87a.mp4?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the Lazarus Complex from rogue machines and environmental threats. Build automated defenses, upgrade your mobile platform, and deploy countermeasures during storms and system breaches. Safeguard the vulnerable human seeds and ensure the sanctuary remains operational while under siege. Strategic choices in protection systems can determine the fate of the last generation of humans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LAUNCH ROCKETS INTO ORBIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/1b9b31d85b65bd26962e54bfca4b6631.poster.avif?t=1770805760\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/1b9b31d85b65bd26962e54bfca4b6631.webm?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/1b9b31d85b65bd26962e54bfca4b6631.mp4?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore and reactivate the ancient MOSES launch infrastructure to send reborn humans beyond the drowning world. Scavenge for launch codes, refine fuel, and rebuild navigation AI systems to ensure mission success. Each launch is a calculated risk but a necessary one to preserve the species. Watch your nurtured humans ascend into orbit, carrying with them the hopes of humanity\u2019s future.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"My precious experiment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1783560/af91eb98c1878b9dd499ab2b06f33c943554a1a3.jpg"},{"name":"Open for business ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1783560/379a7a725f8c25ad43dc517b5b1ef15082638a54.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice caretaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1783560/91023cc7acf8db2ce8c6c9b48adc8d727c6304ca.jpg"},{"name":"That\u2019s an Artifact, In Fact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1783560/edfe00fdd62942084d6e7631fef7c4da1ed771c7.jpg"},{"name":"Last librarian.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1783560/bb756b1a4431659e68794ecdff34b01104a82433.jpg"},{"name":"Robot the builder.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1783560/880b63a41e37e130275a9c48ee2199d14f8efac1.jpg"},{"name":"This is fixable. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1783560/872f72935918f7c33394afe7715e6af0e43c5919.jpg"},{"name":"Groundhog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1783560/cf0fb03648046d12ecc03b5396ac3ce86c62e842.jpg"},{"name":"It belongs in a museum!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1783560/963733c5d5008b45e718b4345af6759645f8b26b.jpg"},{"name":"Enhance, enhance, enhance.. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1783560/bbd3187d19da27573e88e2eca977d4f56d68aa23.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1783560?t=1770805760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770805760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/372e02dae84b020fe1da6b1838353b1d06efe902/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770805760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/372e02dae84b020fe1da6b1838353b1d06efe902/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770805760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3916150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last caretaker; a reawakened machine tasked with saving the future of the human race. You will explore a vast ocean world featuring a deep crafting system with limited resources, allowing you to forge your path and build the tools to save humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Earth has been swallowed by the ocean as towering megastructures rust under a yawning sky. The Last Caretaker isn't just about survival, it's about discovery. Your choices shape the narrative, offering a personal and thought-provoking adventure that reaches from the sea to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Caretaker is a thoughtful take on the survival-crafting genre, where every decision you make and every action has a consequence. Immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted world where the fate of humanity rests in your hands. Your mission is clear: recover human seeds, reactivate the Lazarus Complex, and launch the last of humanity to the stars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/4800278216694b11d5c98912744370b9.avif?t=1770805760\" width=1024 height=1288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NURTURE HUMANS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/3ce33ea5a0a5d3e77dd474daa9801c6b.poster.avif?t=1770805760\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/3ce33ea5a0a5d3e77dd474daa9801c6b.webm?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/3ce33ea5a0a5d3e77dd474daa9801c6b.mp4?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for and grow human seeds within the Lazarus Complex, managing crucial systems like incubation temperature, nutrient flow, and memory data integration. Unlock advanced biopods and synthetic caretakers to accelerate development and ensure successful revival. Discover emotional imprints and past memories encoded in each seed, piecing together lost human stories as you bring life back into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROTECT HUMANS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/0c61710ca690e57114dffd4779e9b87a.poster.avif?t=1770805760\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/0c61710ca690e57114dffd4779e9b87a.webm?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/0c61710ca690e57114dffd4779e9b87a.mp4?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the Lazarus Complex from rogue machines and environmental threats. Build automated defenses, upgrade your mobile platform, and deploy countermeasures during storms and system breaches. Safeguard the vulnerable human seeds and ensure the sanctuary remains operational while under siege. Strategic choices in protection systems can determine the fate of the last generation of humans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LAUNCH ROCKETS INTO ORBIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/1b9b31d85b65bd26962e54bfca4b6631.poster.avif?t=1770805760\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/1b9b31d85b65bd26962e54bfca4b6631.webm?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/extras/1b9b31d85b65bd26962e54bfca4b6631.mp4?t=1770805760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore and reactivate the ancient MOSES launch infrastructure to send reborn humans beyond the drowning world. Scavenge for launch codes, refine fuel, and rebuild navigation AI systems to ensure mission success. Each launch is a calculated risk but a necessary one to preserve the species. Watch your nurtured humans ascend into orbit, carrying with them the hopes of humanity\u2019s future.</p>","developers":["Channel37 Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1783560/21c5b743b880ac0744db264d33b152173c90e50c/header.jpg?t=1770805760","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"The Last Caretaker is developed and published by Channel37 Ltd. Copyright \u00a9 Channel37 Ltd 2025. \"The Last Caretaker\" is a trademark of Channel37 Ltd. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1783560/899292575/c2c865efe56aadca71a4f55b44da392a2259fb61/1762452322/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762453946","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1783560/899292575/c2c865efe56aadca71a4f55b44da392a2259fb61/1762452322/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762453946","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1783560/899292575/c2c865efe56aadca71a4f55b44da392a2259fb61/1762452322/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762453946","id":257227817,"name":"Early Access Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227817/14a462ce99ecd02ed05ab8861e47d8ebdaa61dfa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762453946"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1783560/1676321900/1512e5b5376dfb15c5bd1923d64d266b63b6e73b/1755792959/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755941727","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1783560/1676321900/1512e5b5376dfb15c5bd1923d64d266b63b6e73b/1755792959/da